OL,3,GNEWSAConservatives pledge 275 more
OL,4,Aofficers for region
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Conservatives have pledged to
OL,7,Frecruit an additional 275 police
OL,8,Fofficers across Lincolnshire and East
OL,9,FYorkshire if the party returns to
OL,10,Fgovernment, as part of plans to tackle
OL,11,Fcrime and antisocial behaviour.
OL,13,FUnder the proposals, Lincolnshire
OL,14,FPolice would receive 124 additional
OL,15,Fofficers, while Humberside Police would
OL,16,Fgain 151.
OL,18,FThe party said the new recruits would
OL,19,Fhelp tackle antisocial behaviour,
OL,20,Fshoplifting and knife crime, which it
OL,21,Fclaimed were damaging public confidence
OL,22,Fand community safety.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,385,380,200,160,0,100
